--- !u!114 &114531656
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 114531651}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0dff2782361cb9d428a50273270cd055, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  outcomeData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5c8fbb47286e4d3459d7fd16089de6c2, type: 2}
  choiceType: 27
  responseText: {fileID: 369083105}
  PlayerResponses:
  - "I don\u2019t have all day. Hand it over your supplise before I change my mind."
  - "Sigh\u2026 really? This again? Just give me your stuff."
  - "Sigh\u2026 really? This again? Just give me your stuff."
  - "You can talk all you want, but it won\u2019t change anything. Supplies. Now."
  - "I\u2019ve been doing this too long to waste time. Give up your supplies."
  - "Look, I don\u2019t care about your story. Just your supplies."
  - "Oh, great\u2026 more talking. Can we skip to part where you hand over your supplies?"
  - Save your breath. I just want your supplies.
  - Not interested in your life story. Just the bag.
  - "You think I care? Just drop what you\u2019ve got."
  - "Don\u2019t drag this out. Supplies, now."
  - "I don\u2019t need your excuses, I need your rations."
  - Not here to chat. Just here for your stuff.
  - "You can keep whining. I\u2019ll still take your supplies."
  - "You\u2019ve got one job right now\u2014empty your pack."
  - "You\u2019re not the first. Won\u2019t be the last. Now give me your stuff."
  - You done? Good. Now hand over your supplies.
  - Por favor. No ablo inglis amigo. Now hand over your shits.
  - You are our massiah. Only if you save us with your rations.
  - Two choices. Hand over your supplies willingly or I kill you and take your stuff.
  - Wow, great speech. You done? Cool. Now gimme the bag.
  - "Yeah, yeah, tragic story. I\u2019ll cry later. Supplies, please."
  - Great, another survivor with something to say. I just wanted the supplies.
  - "Hand it over. Call it a donation to the \u2018keep me alive\u2019 fund."
  - "Don\u2019t worry, I recycle. Your supplies will be put to good use."
  - "Sharing is caring\u2026 except I don\u2019t care, so just share."
  - "I\u2019ll trade you\u2014your supplies for me not stabbing you. Fair deal, right?"
  - 'Good news: you get to live. Bad news: you get to live hungry.'
  - "Smile! You\u2019re making my day easier by handing me your bag."
