  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  outcomeData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5c8fbb47286e4d3459d7fd16089de6c2, type: 2}
  choiceType: 25
  responseText: {fileID: 855265431}
  PlayerResponses:
  - "Walk away now\u2026 or things get ugly for everyone."
  - I suggest both of you leave before this gets messy.
  - "Don\u2019t test me. You can leave\u2026 or regret it."
  - "Step back and walk away\u2026 while you still can."
  - "I\u2019m not asking twice. Leave\u2026 now."
  - "Look, I don\u2019t want anyone hurt. You can leave peacefully."
  - "I know this isn\u2019t easy\u2026 it\u2019s okay to walk away."
  - "You don\u2019t have to fight. Go, stay safe."
  - "I understand\u2026 take the chance to leave before it\u2019s too late."
  - "You\u2019ve been through enough. Step away, it\u2019s fine."
  - "I\u2019m not here to hurt anyone. Walk away and keep your lives."
  - "There\u2019s no shame in leaving\u2026 it\u2019s the smart choice."
  - I care about both of us. You can step back safely.
  - No need to fight. Walk away and live another day
  - "Take this chance. I won\u2019t stop you from leaving."
  - "Do as you please\u2026 leave or stay, your choice."
  - "Walk away if you want. Or not. Doesn\u2019t matter to me."
  - "I\u2019m not stopping anyone\u2026 go ahead, leave."
  - "Look, I don\u2019t have time for this. Just leave."
  - "I\u2019ve had enough\u2026 just walk away and save yourself."
  - "Don\u2019t make me deal with this right now\u2026 leave."
  - "I\u2019m tired of fighting. Step aside, go on."
  - "This is exhausting\u2026 just get the hell out of here."
